{"uid":"d44d8bc30bf2f7f9","name":"test_a_workspace_filed_petitions_adjudication_write_back_is_a_noop_against_the_tree","fullName":"tests.test_petitions#test_a_workspace_filed_petitions_adjudication_write_back_is_a_noop_against_the_tree","historyId":"98e476fdc27cc1df6e47945720c6a068","time":{"start":1791880810359,"stop":1791880810383,"duration":24},"description":"The companion case: an obligation filed the OLD way -- straight into\n    the workspace's tracked wave file, as every pre-065 engine build did --\n    gets no write-back at all through the new, run-scoped path: `run=self.\n    run` means only `run.petitions_file` is ever searched, so the\n    workspace file is left completely untouched (byte-for-byte) and no\n    commit is made. This is requirement N.6's own claim -- \"no write to a\n    tracked `*-petitions.md` file in the workspace\" -- holding even for a\n    petition this run itself never filed there.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The companion case: an obligation filed the OLD way -- straight into<br />\nthe workspace's tracked wave file, as every pre-065 engine build did --<br />\ngets no write-back at all through the new, run-scoped path: <code>run=self. run</code> means only <code>run.petitions_file</code> is ever searched, so the<br />\nworkspace file is left completely untouched (byte-for-byte) and no<br />\ncommit is made. This is requirement N.6's own claim -- &quot;no write to a<br />\ntracked <code>*-petitions.md</code> file in the workspace&quot; -- holding even for a<br />\npetition this run itself never filed there.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791880795037,"stop":1791880795037,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path